<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's spot rupee rates in the kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.30		 41.40</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	69.55		 69.65</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.40		 23.40</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.365		 0.367</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.00		 11.02</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.25		 11.27</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.09		  1.11</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.10 pct	    2.30 pct</p>
</text>
